OL,3,AE-motorbikes seized by police sold on
OL,4,Aat auction, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FAcross the UK, police sold 161 e-bikes
OL,7,Fand e-motorcycles last year and 54 in
OL,8,F2024, although the real number could be
OL,9,Fhigher because not every force
OL,10,Fresponded to the BBC's Freedom of
OL,11,FInformation request.
OL,13,FSome of the forces said they had now
OL,14,Fended the practice, but others defended
OL,15,Fit as a way of putting "money back into
OL,16,Fpolicing".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
